### Get Calendar History
GET {{base_url}}/pub/v1/calendar/connected/{{user_id}}/history HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Ofw-Client: {{client}}
Ofw-Version: {{version}}

